  "problem": "The data below is taken from the table of values of the cumulative distribution function $Φ(z)$ for the standard normal distribution. Given that $X∼N(6,{3}^{2}),$ compute $P(7.26<X<8.85).$ Use the tables below and do not round your answer.\n\n<table align=\"center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"5\" rules=\"all\">\n<tbody><tr> <th width=\"25%\" bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$z$</th><th bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$\\,0.00\\,$</th><th bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$\\,0.01\\,$</th><th bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$\\,0.02\\,$</th>\n</tr><tr> <th bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$\\,0.4\\,$</th><td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.6554\\,$ </td><td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.6591\\,$ </td><td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.6628\\,$ </td></tr>\n<tr> <th bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$\\,0.5\\,$</th><td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.6915\\,$ </td><td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.6950\\,$ </td><td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.6985\\,$ </td></tr>\n<tr> <th bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$\\,0.6\\,$</th><td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.7257\\,$ </td><td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.7291\\,$ </td><td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.7324\\,$ </td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</th>\n\n<th width=\"5%\"></th>\n\n<th>\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"5\" rules=\"all\">\n<tbody><tr> <th width=\"25%\" bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$z$</th><th bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$\\,0.05\\,$</th><th bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$\\,0.06\\,$</th><th bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$\\,0.07\\,$</th>\n</tr><tr> <th bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$\\,0.9\\,$</th><td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.8289\\,$ </td><td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.8315\\,$ </td><td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.8340\\,$ </td></tr>\n<tr> <th bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$\\,1.0\\,$</th><td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.8531\\,$ </td><td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.8554\\,$ </td><td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.8577\\,$ </td></tr>\n<tr> <th bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align